.\"
.\" Prose template for share/man/man1/dot.1. The DOMAINS, FLAGS, SHORTCUTS,
.\" OLD NAMES, EXIT STATUS and SEE ALSO lists are generated from the plugin
.\" manifests (lib/dot/data/commands.txt) and schemas/cli/flags.json by
.\" tools/docs/gen_manpages.py: edit THIS file for prose, the manifests for
.\" commands, then run `make man`. CI fails when a page is stale.
.TH DOT 1 "@DATE@" "dotfiles v@VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dot \- manage this machine, its shell, its agents and its configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dot
.I domain
.RI [ object ]
.I verb
.RI [ args ]
.br
.B dot help
.RI [ domain
.RI [ object ]
.IR verb ]
.br
.B dot help all
.br
.B dot help \-\-json
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dot
is the control plane for a chezmoi-managed dotfiles system. Its commands
are grouped into one-word domains, each a plugin with its own page,
.BR dot\-<domain> (1).
A domain or an object alone does its read-only default.
.PP
Every command accepts
.B \-\-help
and
.BR \-h .
Run
.B dot help all
for every command,
.B dot help
.I term
to search, and
.B dot cli completion show
.I shell
for the completion script, generated from the same manifests as this page.
.SH DOMAINS
@DOMAINS@
.SH FLAGS
These flags mean the same thing in every command that takes them.
@FLAGS@
.SH SHORTCUTS
@SHORTCUTS@
.SH OLD NAMES
Names from before the domains. A deprecated name still runs and prints its
new spelling until the release shown; after it, and for a removed name,
.B dot
exits 127 with the new spelling.
@ALIASES@
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DOTFILES_FAST=1
Skip heavy layers (zinit, completions) for fast startup.
.TP
.B DOTFILES_ULTRA_FAST=1
Bare minimum shell (aliases + prompt only).
.TP
.B DOTFILES_AI=1
Enable AI helper scripts.
.TP
.B DOTFILES_NONINTERACTIVE=1
Force non-interactive mode (for CI/scripts).
.TP
.B DOTFILES_PREWARM_ON_APPLY=1
Auto-prewarm caches after dot apply (default: enabled).
.TP
.B CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR
Override the resolved source tree. Used by packaged installs that keep
the framework outside
.IR ~/.dotfiles .
.TP
.B NO_COLOR=1
Disable ANSI colour in every command.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.dotfiles/
Repository root (chezmoi source).
.TP
.I ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml
Per-machine overrides.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dotfiles/commands/
User-provided custom dot commands.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dotfiles/modules.d/
User-provided aliases and functions.
.TP
.I ~/.config/zsh/rc.d.local/
User-provided zsh initialization scripts.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dotfiles.log
Local action log. No telemetry leaves the machine.
.SH EXIT STATUS
@EXIT@
.SH SEE ALSO
@PAGES@,
.BR chezmoi (1),
.BR mise (1),
.BR zsh (1)
.PP
Manual: https://doc.dotfiles.io/ \(em source in
.I docs/manual/
of the repository.
